{"anime_data":{"id":415779,"name":"進撃の巨人 The Final Season 完結編 後編","name_cn":"进击的巨人 最终季 完结篇 后篇","short_summary":"「その巨人はいついかなる時代においても、自由を求めて進み続けた。自由のために戦った。名は──進撃の巨人」。ついに明かされた壁の外の真実と、巨人の正体。ここに至るまで、人類はあまりにも大きすぎる犠牲を払っていた。それでもなお、彼らは進み続けな","score":7.6,"image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/d3/dc/415779_6TeGp.jpg","eps":1,"date":"2023-11-04","summary":"「その巨人はいついかなる時代においても、自由を求めて進み続けた。自由のために戦った。名は──進撃の巨人」。ついに明かされた壁の外の真実と、巨人の正体。ここに至るまで、人類はあまりにも大きすぎる犠牲を払っていた。それでもなお、彼らは進み続けなければならない。壁の外にある海を、自由の象徴を、まだその目で見ていないのだから。──やがて時は流れ、一度目の「超大型巨人」襲来から6年。調査兵団はウォール・マリア外への壁外調査を敢行する。「壁の向こうには海があって、海の向こうには自由がある。ずっとそう信じてた……」。壁の中の人類が、初めて辿り着いた海。果てしなく広がる水平線の先にあるのは自由か、それとも……？エレン・イェーガーの物語は、新たな局面を迎える。\r\n\r\nテレビ放送時は85分スペシャルとして放送。2023年11月19日より各話版として通常枠に分割し、新たにOP・EDを追加したものが配信された。\r\n第三章 天と地の戦い\r\n第四章 長い夢\r\n最終章 あの丘の木に向かって\r\n\r\n各話版サブタイトル：\r\n91 天と地の戦い\r\n92 心臓を捧げよ\r\n93 長い夢\r\n94 あの丘の木に向かって","total_episodes":2,"characters":[{"id":18101,"name":"エレン・イェーガー","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/e3/2f/18101_crt_343At.jpg?r=1410320023","actor_ids":[5209],"name_cn":"艾伦·耶格尔","summary":"本作的男主角。15岁（835年生）。拥有强韧的精神力与非凡的行动力，对墙壁外的世界拥有比任何人都要高的憧憬。\r\n故事之初（845年）居住的城镇被未知的“超大型巨人”袭击，“玛利亚之墙”（Wall．Maria）城门遭其脚踢破坏，巨人因而进入第一道城墙区猎食人类，目睹母亲遭巨人吞食后，立誓要消灭所有的巨人。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":3,"birth_day":30,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"艾伦·耶格尔","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"3月30日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"170cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"63kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"年龄","value":"10岁→15岁→19岁","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"kyojinchu.tv/character","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":18102,"name":"ミカサ・アッカーマン","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/21/40/18102_crt_nVMeD.jpg?r=1700166918","actor_ids":[5727],"name_cn":"三笠·阿克曼","summary":"本作的女主角。15岁（835年生）。由于身为艾连的青梅竹马之故，两人经常一起行动。沉默寡言、表情稀少的美少女，有腹肌。\r\n第104期训练兵团第1名毕业。拥有优秀的身体能力与战斗技术，一人的表现就足以与100名士兵匹敌。为了和艾连一起行动，希望加入调查兵团。\r\n在9岁时曾被绑匪绑票，双亲亦被绑匪杀害，后来被艾连救出，自此之后便一直寄居在艾连家中，并把艾连视为“最重要的亲人”。\r\n于第21话中最终选择加入调查军团。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":2,"birth_day":10,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"三笠·阿克曼","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"2月10日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"170cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"68kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"kyojinchu.tv/character","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":19546,"name":"リヴァイ","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/e5/b3/19546_crt_UP2v0.jpg?r=1611927735","actor_ids":[4232],"name_cn":"利威尔","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":12,"birth_day":25,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"利威尔","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"12月25日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"160cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"65kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":19616,"name":"アルミン・アルレルト","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/4a/67/19616_crt_88rMm.jpg?r=1410320151","actor_ids":[4382],"name_cn":"阿明·阿诺德","summary":"艾连与米卡莎的儿时玩伴。15岁（835年生）。缺乏体力，身体能力也不高，本人说过，光是能通过毕业战斗模拟测验就已经是奇迹了。\r\n以清晰的头脑与丰富的知识，在课堂上得到了顶尖的成绩。自己希望加入调查兵团。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":11,"birth_day":3,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"阿明·阿诺德","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"11月3日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"163cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"55kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":19617,"name":"ジャン・キルシュタイン","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/28/76/19617_crt_5ffza.jpg?r=1410320344","actor_ids":[4678],"name_cn":"让·基尔休坦","summary":"第104期训练兵团第6名毕业。\r\n擅长充分运用立体机动装置的性能，同时亦有看清现况的能力。个性过于锐利，与队友容易产生冲突，尤其是艾连。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":4,"birth_day":7,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"让·基尔休坦","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"4月7日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"175cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"65kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":19618,"name":"アニ・レオンハート","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/65/aa/19618_crt_dOIIW.jpg?r=1493555519","actor_ids":[4933],"name_cn":"亚妮·雷恩哈特","summary":"第104期训练兵团第4名毕业。\r\n感情表现贫乏的少女。\r\n性格我行我素，说话刻薄，难以进行团体合作。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":3,"birth_day":22,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"亚妮·雷恩哈特","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"3月22日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"153cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"54kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":19620,"name":"クリスタ・レンズ","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/5f/b6/19620_crt_mvKGz.jpg?r=1410320875","actor_ids":[5105],"name_cn":"克里斯塔·连兹","summary":"第104期训练兵团第10名毕业。\r\n短发大眼的少女。因为很希望可以被人认为不是不重要的人，而会对他人做付出，以提升自己的价值。\r\n天生的气质连发狂的动物都会平静并亲近她，被同期生称为“女神”。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":1,"birth_day":15,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"克里斯塔·连兹","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"1月15日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"145cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"42kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":19621,"name":"コニー・スプリンガー","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/ed/56/19621_crt_5FAy3.jpg?r=1410321103","actor_ids":[4262],"name_cn":"柯尼·史普林格","summary":"第104期训练兵团第8名毕业。\r\n光头的小个子少年。一开始以加入宪兵团为志愿，被艾连的演说感动后决定加入调查兵团。\r\n平衡感觉良好，懂得在行动时加入一些小聪明。但头脑运转迟钝，经常在作战时判断错误。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":5,"birth_day":2,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"柯尼·史普林格","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"5月2日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"158cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"58kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":19623,"name":"ライナー・ブラウン","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/97/c6/19623_crt_Z676U.jpg?r=1611672686","actor_ids":[4982],"name_cn":"莱纳·布朗","summary":"第104期训练兵团第2名毕业。\r\n拥有强韧的体格和精神力，经常得到同伴深深的信任。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":8,"birth_day":1,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"莱纳·布朗","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"8月1日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"185cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"95kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"年龄","value":"12岁→17岁→21岁","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"https://shingeki.tv/season1/character/#9","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":32496,"name":"ジーク・イェーガー","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/74/31/32496_crt_ZnT23.jpg?r=1675354860","actor_ids":[1096],"name_cn":"吉克·耶格尔","summary":"黄发毛脸眼镜男，性格狡诈残忍，爱说骚话，投掷能力一流。\r\n马莱战士长，莱纳等人的上级，艾伦的同父异母的哥哥。母亲是有艾尔迪亚王族血统，所以他也有着艾尔迪亚王族血统，现任兽之巨人宿主。\r\n拥有将脊髓液注入艾尔迪亚人的身体，通过吼叫的方式激活，将其变成无脑巨人的能力，并能借此一定程度对无脑巨人下达简单命令。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":8,"birth_day":1,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"吉克·耶格尔","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"8月1日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"183cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"92kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":53109,"name":"グリシャ・イェーガー","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/0b/4e/53109_crt_SOx8E.jpg?r=1491216913","actor_ids":[4855],"name_cn":"格里夏·耶格尔","summary":"艾伦的父亲，职业是医生","birth_year":null,"birth_month":1,"birth_day":26,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"格里夏·耶格尔","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"1月26日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"182cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"78kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":88162,"name":"ガビ・ブラウン","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/a9/81/88162_crt_5cDt2.jpg?r=1607320529","actor_ids":[5745],"name_cn":"贾碧·布朗","summary":"【战士】的候补，同时也是莱纳的表妹。目前正在为继承下一任【铠之巨人】而努力。性格天真烂漫，大胆无畏。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":4,"birth_day":14,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"贾碧·布朗","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"4月14日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"138cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"30kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"年龄","value":"12岁","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":88163,"name":"ファルコ・グライス","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/af/3a/88163_crt_N4mNM.jpg?r=1607321225","actor_ids":[7772],"name_cn":"法尔克·格莱斯","summary":"【战士】的候补，为了保护贾碧，和她一同立下了【继承铠之巨人】的志向。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":2,"birth_day":10,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"法尔克·格莱斯","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"2月10日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"140cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"34kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"年龄","value":"12岁","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":88547,"name":"ピーク・フィンガー","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/b3/f5/88547_crt_8K4aa.jpg?r=1607918362","actor_ids":[5824],"name_cn":"皮克·芬格尔","summary":"【战士】，【车力】巨人的持有者，具备着相当出色的判断力。【车力】的长时间四足步行十分消耗体力，导致她总是一副懒洋洋的模样。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":8,"birth_day":5,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"皮克·芬格尔","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"8月5日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"155cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"42kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":130935,"name":"調査兵団","relation":"客串","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/5a/5e/130935_crt_smzTT.jpg","actor_ids":[],"name_cn":"调查兵团","summary":"在《进击的巨人》世界观设定中，以“自由之翼”为标志的调查兵团是人类的军团部门中的最强军事力量。\r\n拥有与其他兵团不可比拟的超强战斗力，常期在墙外进行巡逻调查捕杀巨人，\r\n但每次出巡都会造成惨重的伤亡，也为人类未来与探知付出了重要的贡献。\r\n抱着必死的决心挑战墙外巨人领域。死亡率最高，所以是一般新兵绝不愿意加入的兵团。\r\n人类阵营中的革命派。士兵精锐度远非其他兵团可比，因为长期在前线与巨人战斗，所以几乎人人都具有非凡的战斗能力。\r\n新兵第一次参加墙外远征的死亡几率是五成，能够撑过来的人将会逐渐成为生存几率高的优秀士兵。是艾伦梦想加入的兵团。\r\n兵团徽章是重叠起来的鸟儿翅膀，为蓝白双色，寓意人类拒绝承受家畜般地笼中屈辱，始终向往自由的愿望。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"调查兵团","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"https://zh.moegirl.org.cn/调查兵团","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":142285,"name":"オニャンコポン","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/11/91/142285_crt_l0Nnh.jpg","actor_ids":[19396],"name_cn":"欧良果彭","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":8,"birth_day":2,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"欧良果彭","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"8月2日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"176cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"75kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":142286,"name":"レオンハート","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/76/31/142286_crt_u7E3r.jpg","actor_ids":[3981],"name_cn":"雷恩哈特","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"雷恩哈特","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":142287,"name":"カリナ・ブラウン","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/76/41/142287_crt_151u5.jpg","actor_ids":[4734],"name_cn":"","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":9,